OL,3,GNEWSAPolice issue dispersal order for
OL,4,Amarket town
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have issued a dispersal order in
OL,7,FMelbourne following an increase in
OL,8,Freports of anti-social behaviour.
OL,10,FThe Section 34 order came into force at
OL,11,F16:00 BST on Friday and will remain in
OL,12,Fplace until 16:00 on Sunday, covering
OL,13,Fthe area around the centre of the town.
OL,15,FThe order gives officers the power to
OL,16,Fdirect groups of two or more people to
OL,17,Fleave the designated area if they are
OL,18,Finvolved in anti-social behaviour, or
OL,19,Fif police believe they are likely to
OL,20,Fcause harassment, alarm or distress to
OL,21,Fothers.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
