OL,3,GNEWSAPolice issue dispersal order for
OL,4,Amarket town
OL,5,
OL,6,FOfficers said the measure had been
OL,7,Fintroduced in response to growing
OL,8,Fconcerns from residents about nuisance
OL,9,Fbehaviour in the area.
